{"root":"maklum","ipa":"/ˈmaklum/","core":"了解，明白，知晓；通常指对某事有充分的认识或理解，常用于表示谅解或告知。","pos":["动词","形容词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈmaklum/","zh":"了解，知晓","phrases":[{"t":"harap maklum","zh":"敬请谅解"},{"t":"sudah maklum","zh":"众所周知"},{"t":"maklum akan","zh":"了解关于..."}],"examples":[{"t":"Harap maklum bahwa kantor akan tutup besok.","zh":"敬请知悉，办公室明天将关闭。"},{"t":"Dia sudah maklum dengan situasi tersebut.","zh":"他已经了解了那种情况。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"maklum","ipa":"/ˈmaklum/","zh":"了解，知晓","phrase":{"t":"maklum saja","zh":"也就理解了"},"example":{"t":"Maklum saja, dia masih baru di sini.","zh":"也就理解了，他在这里还是新人。"}},{"w":"memaklumi","ipa":"/məˈmaklumi/","zh":"体谅，谅解","phrase":{"t":"memaklumi keadaan","zh":"体谅情况"},"example":{"t":"Saya memaklumi keterlambatan Anda.","zh":"我体谅您的迟到。"}},{"w":"pemakluman","ipa":"/pəmakˈluman/","zh":"通知，告知，谅解","phrase":{"t":"surat pemakluman","zh":"通知书"},"example":{"t":"Kami telah menerima pemakluman resmi.","zh":"我们已经收到了正式通知。"}},{"w":"dimaklumi","ipa":"/diˈmaklumi/","zh":"被理解，被知晓","phrase":{"t":"hal yang dimaklumi","zh":"可以理解的事情"},"example":{"t":"Kesalahan itu dapat dimaklumi.","zh":"那个错误是可以被谅解的。"}}],"derSlugs":["maklum","memaklumi","pemakluman","dimaklumi"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-10-01T02:17:53.775Z","src":"base"}